WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.500
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.390
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.360
My name is Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:15.000
I'm a fledgling idol aspiring to reach the top like Kanzaki Mizuki-chan.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.920
I'm putting everything I have into doing Aikatsu that everyone will love at the idol training school, Starlight Academy.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:25.260
Aikatsu stands for "idol activities", which includes applying for auditions and getting gigs.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.040
To performers, these cards are life itself.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:32.540
We use Aikatsu cards to choose our own outfits and stages.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.080
I applied for all sorts for auditions,

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:39.060
and even created an autograph with a little help from my friend Ran.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.660
I feel more fulfilled than ever before.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:47.500
However, the road to becoming a top idol is a lot harsher than I expected.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.600
I have to try even harder!

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.340
Ahem, I am currently outside of the theater.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:04.780
I'm currently on my way to return the props we used for drama class to the underground storeroom.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:12.080
Ahem, I am now in the basement.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.640
It's kind of dark and spacious...

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.840
I'm lost.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.240
Huh, what's that?

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.200
Who's dancing over there?

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.120
They're so cool!

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.470
Hi, signalize!

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:09.810
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:09.810
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:11.700
No, that's wrong

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:11.700
iie chigau yo

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:17.080
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:17.080
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:18.870
Do that signalize!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.050
Something's starting to bubble up

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.050
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:28.010
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:28.010
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.550
So I'll believe in the present

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.550
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:36.720
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:36.720
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:38.060
Chance for me

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:43.360
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:43.360
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:47.570
It's just another challenge on the way

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:47.570
hora chousen matteru yo

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:52.490
Where are we headed?

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:52.490
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.240
Into a brilliant hope

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.240
mabushii kibou no nake e

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:03.500
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:03.500
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.880
Where we're headed

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.880
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.760
is into our hopes for the future

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.760
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:18.090
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:18.100
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.040
Huh? An underground studio?

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:31.300
Yeah. There was this really cool person dancing down there.

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:35.640
I had no idea that there'd be a studio in a place like that.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:39.620
There are still all kinds of mysteries in Starlight Academy, huh.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:43.300
If you want a mystery, then how about the girl who sits over there

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.800
who we haven't met once since transferring in?

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.820
That's right...

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.880
I wonder what kind of girl she is?

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.260
Let's ask Ran.

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:56.040
Hey, Ran—

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:57.700
Stop!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.800
It's showtime!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.600
That surprised me.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:05.840
I'm already used to it.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:11.820
Sensational Audition coming soon!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:16.610
The season for the Sensational Student Audition has come this year as well.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:18.600
Sensation?

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:24.400
The headmistress determines the most sensational girl in each grade.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:28.600
In other words, it's an audition to decide which student gathered the most attention in the world this year.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:34.940
If you pass, you'll also be taken on a trip to Hawaii to help with collecting data for a magazine photo shoot.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:35.960
Wow...

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.880
Waiiha!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.880
Th-That was scary!

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.360
Get used to him already.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.400
Ran's probably the top candidate this year too.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.600
There's no way she wouldn't be.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:49.620
Awesome! Ran's the top candidate.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:55.060
Every year I end up competing against the same opponent,

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.380
but I've still never beaten her.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.200
No way.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:02.900
Is there really someone in our year who gets more attention than Ran?

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.200
Bright.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.820
Everyone, nice to see you all again.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:18.840
You're the same as ever, Flash.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.180
Flash?

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:23.060
That's Hikari. Minowa Hikari.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.580
I've heard of her!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:29.080
Not only are her dance performances phenomenal, but her singing is on another level.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:32.000
Even though she's talented beyond belief,

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:35.400
she's never once been on stage in public.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:35.980
Wow.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.480
Excuse me.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.240
It's nice to meet you.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.380
Nice to meet you.

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.280
My name is Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.720
I'm Kiriya Aoi.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:58.260
Please get along well with us.

00:05:58.260 --> 00:05:59.280
Stop it.

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.720
If you carelessly get near her...

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.720
You'll just get burned.

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:05.100
Cool!

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.620
Cool and sexy and beauty!

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:08.860
Which one?

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:09.880
All of them!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:10.680
Yeah!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:14.500
What's with these two? I don't remember seeing them before.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:17.860
They transferred in while you were doing your Net Live Tour.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.600
Net live tour?

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.280
A concert that you watch online.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:26.320
It's broadcast in real time all over the world.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.140
Wow.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:31.040
Hikari kept herself alone in the studio during the concerts

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.920
and didn't leave even a single time.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:35.160
It was all so she could focus better.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.960
So that's why we haven't met until now.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.420
You're stoic and cool just like I've heard!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:44.020
For some reason, talking to the two of you throws me off.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.680
They're always this excited.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.180
And th-they're my...

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.300
Friends!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.760
Friends...

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:57.060
Well, whatever. We're competing again this year, Ran.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:58.300
Right.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:08.740
So the person who Ran's never beaten before was Minowa Hikari-chan, huh.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:09.620
Yeah.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:12.840
She must be amazing to be able to compete with Ran.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.480
It's the epitome of kill or be killed.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:16.940
A life or death battle.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.100
In what way?

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.940
Well, if I want to go up against Hikari,

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.060
I need at least that level of determination.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.580
She's like the eternal burning sun.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:30.440
If you get too close, you're likely to get burned.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.820
Her body temperature's high?

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:33.340
Where'd you get that from?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.600
Now I really want to see Hikari-chan's concert.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.180
That's right! We can watch it in our room.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.580
It's up on the internet.

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.080
Let's go watch!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.500
Ran, let's go.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:43.440
Sorry.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.600
I'll have to refrain.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.380
Do you have a lesson for the audition?

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.620
I'm always doing my best.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.980
I don't need any special lessons.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.580
Ran's cool too!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.460
Yeah!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.880
Let's finish this up quick and get to watching Hikari-chan's concert.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.380
So, just where is this storeroom?

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.380
Well, I do know that it's definitely in the basement somewhere.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.880
So you say, but that's too vague.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.260
The storeroom's pretty hard to find.

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:23.260
I might've gotten lost again.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.780
Let's try this way.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:30.920
There's a light on over there.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.420
Ah, that's it!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.280
It's the underground studio I saw!

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:44.520
Look, look! Isn't she cool?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.280
Yeah. I wonder who it is?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.480
What?

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.680
Ah, Hikari-chan!

00:08:58.420 --> 00:08:59.900
Good work.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.800
Were you two watching me?

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:02.720
Yes!

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:05.500
We were looking for the underground storeroom...

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:08.920
My concerts are for my fans.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.540
Even if it's just a rehearsal, I won't allow anyone else to watch me!

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.640
I'm sorry.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.200
But you were so cool!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.020
Like a pro among pros!

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.060
Forget about it.

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:28.040
I want to see Hikari-chan's live concert as soon as I can!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.780
I know, I know.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.050
Ran?

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.720
So you were practicing your dance here.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.140
Y-Yeah...

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:44.340
I can't seem to calm down.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.850
"I'm always doing my best."

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.720
"I don't need any special lessons." 
 I keep saying those things...

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:51.860
It's pathetic.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:55.340
Minowa Hikari-chan must be pretty strong if she's making you feel like that.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.220
My usual really isn't enough.

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:59.740
Not if I want to compete with Hikari.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:03.620
Amazing! You, for thinking that, 
and Hikari-chan, for making you think that—

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:04.900
You're both amazing!

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:08.240
Yeah! You two are real rivals, huh.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.820
Great! Idols really are great!

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.380
I'm gonna do it too!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.000
I'm getting pumped up too.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.000
Hikari-chan got angry at us just a minute ago.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.460
When we saw Hikari-chan's lesson, she said,

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:22.080
"My concerts are for my fans,

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.840
so even if it's just a rehearsal, I won't allow anyone else to watch me!"

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:26.080
And got mad...

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:28.480
That's Hikari's style.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:31.500
She devotes everything she has to her fans.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.140
Even if she can't see them directly.

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:37.500
Hikari is the real deal.

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:47.100
Ran seems really different from usual.

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:49.040
Ran is really feeling desperate.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.640
I wonder what Hikari-chan's concerts are like?

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.600
Everyone, I've missed you!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.600
I was thinking about all of you this whole time.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.600
Every single day, I've...

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:12.880
Amazing!

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:13.720
She's really into it.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:17.700
You can't see your fans during a net concert, right?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:20.260
Even so, it's like they're all together anyway.

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:24.240
The fans can feel Hikari-chan's burning emotions.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:26.200
Hikari-chan is wonderful!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.660
Not to mention how her fans are.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:33.380
I see. So Minowa finally came out.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.960
She was as bright as usual.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.240
Flash!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:41.300
Bepp-sensei, how long do you intend to keep that character up?

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.820
To the end of the act, when it has become my flesh and blood.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.740
Life is showtime!

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.760
Those are your words, Headmistress.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:55.740
Right. Everyone is the protagonist of the play called their life.

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:58.740
If you dream of it, you can become anything you want.

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:01.620
I want to teach all of these children that fact.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:04.520
Good job...

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:05.700
Me!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.040
You?!

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.200
<i>Perfect nourishment!!</i>

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.020
<i>It's Ichigo and Aoi's special juice.</i>

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.260
It's from Ran.

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.640
"Want to come over for some juice?

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.600
Actually, get over here. I can't finish this huge container alone!"

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:35.600
So it says.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.070
I guess it was a bit too big.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.680
I told you so...

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:41.740
But now we can go see Ran's room!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:42.960
It's our first time over!

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.900
It's so tidy.

00:12:45.900 --> 00:12:47.760
It's nice, simple, and boyish!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.720
Yeah, it's not like a girl's room at all!

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.520
Are you trying to compliment me?

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.780
Ran, don't you get lonely without a roommate?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.340
Too bad we couldn't live in a three person room.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.720
Then every day would be like a school trip.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.780
Sounds fun!

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:05.380
Give me a break.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:07.640
What? Why not?

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.050
Look, I already drank some.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.140
It was really good.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.040
Yay!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.460
It was worth remaking it so many times.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.060
Yeah!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.340
I don't usually drink sweet juice,

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:19.940
but this was delicious.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.420
Thank goodness I didn't put yakiniku in.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.540
Yakiniku?!

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.760
Ichigo said that you might've been hungry,

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:30.760
so she tried to make a yakiniku drink, but I stopped her for now.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:33.580
Not just for now, stop it forever!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:38.320
How pretty. I've never seen these cards before.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.820
Are you using them for the audition?

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:42.060
Spicy Ageha?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:45.660
I use that brand of clothes for my real battles.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:47.600
They look really hard to get.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:51.120
Yeah. I've wanted this brand since forever ago.

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:55.100
When I wear Spicy Ageha outfits, I feel like I can put in more effort,

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.600
and it really raises my spirits.

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.060
They suit you! {ugh tense/number agreement}

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.000
They're mature and sexy.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.840
It was about half a year ago...

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:06.420
I got the chance to meet the designer for Spicy Ageha.

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:15.080
Shibuki, that woman was the charismatic model who helped start up Spicy Ageha,

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.020
the chief designer.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.800
Does she have a meeting with the headmistress?

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:25.420
Either way, she very rarely comes to the Academy.

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.800
It's a showtime.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:35.920
I'll fly!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:41.020
I love Spicy Ageha clothes.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.720
So I'll definitely fly upon the stage, just like an ageha!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:55.740
After that, I got the chance to wear a 
Spicy Ageha coord for a fashion show.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.440
I put everything into it.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:01.080
I didn't know if that person would be watching me,

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.440
but I performed as if I could see her myself.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:05.780
Right.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:12.440
And then those rare cards and this message were sent to me.

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:15.740
<i>You can surely fly even higher.</i>

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:20.660
I feel like the chief designer is telling me to do my best.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.480
That's why I want to wear these for my match with Hikari.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.240
Yeah, do your best!

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:26.500
We'll be cheering for you.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.300
They say you can't fight on an empty stomach,

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:32.240
so should I go ahead and make that yakiniku juice for you?

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.200
I don't want your yakiniku juice.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.760
I think you should give this one up.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:40.080
Then how about I eat yakiniku to raise my power level,

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.780
and cheer for you with all my heart?

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:46.180
Thanks a lot. But don't eat too much.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:48.260
Haven't you gained some weight recently?

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:50.660
What, no way!

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:52.220
It's just a joke.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.340
I'm glad you finally laughed.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.260
You always have a serious look on your face.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:06.520
Let's both do our best out there.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.520
Of course.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.000
Oh yeah,

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:17.920
I'm surprised that you've made some friends after always trying to do everything alone for so long.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:20.460
Friends, huh...

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:23.120
To be honest, I'm surprised too.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:27.920
This is the first time that I've thought to give it my all for the friends who are rooting me on.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:32.720
It might be similar to how you feel for your fans.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.740
Ran...

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.700
You've changed.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.700
You may be right.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.600
Isn't that fine? Then, to the stage.

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:42.700
To the stage!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.180
They're both great!

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:10.940
And they look like they're having so much fun!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:38.580
The result is...

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.820
A tie!

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:44.820
Having both the same level of ability and effort is the mark of a true rival.

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:46.660
The one thing you can say

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:49.640
is that the both of them have grown exceptionally from last year.

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.220
They aren't just repeating the same stage over again.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:53.480
Yes!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:58.280
You were more passionate than I've ever seen you before this year.

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:00.200
Almost hot enough to burn me.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.460
We'll settle this next year, Hikari.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.460
Yeah. See you next year, Ran.

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.040
Good work!

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:17.260
You and Hikari-chan were both so cool!

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:19.960
I want to have a burning concert like that too.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.140
Me too!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:23.500
Oh yeah, Ran! Why don't you coach us?

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:25.360
We're counting on you, Coach Ran!

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:26.660
Coach, Coach!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:29.160
My coaching is pretty harsh, you know.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.660
They you'll be the Demon Coach!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.380
Don't say demon!

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:36.320
But we might be able to do it...

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:37.160
Huh?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.420
Do you want to try it with me?

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:40.600
A Special Audition.

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.040
Special...

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.080
Audition?

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:45.760
I haven't done it before either.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.120
It's a team audition for groups larger than two.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:49.960
I want to try!

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:50.600
Me too!

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:54.300
I want to try fighting alongside you two as well.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:55.780
Yay!

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:57.400
This isn't the time to be cheering.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.840
We need to make sure not to hold Ran back.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:03.340
That's right! We're counting on you, Demon Coach.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:04.800
I told you not to call me "demon"!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:08.960
Mom!

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:13.820
Onee-chan says that she's entering a Special Audition with Aoi-neesan and Ran-san!

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:15.800
Wow, sounds impressive.

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:19.540
It is! It's a Special Audition after all.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:21.180
There's a video attached too.

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:23.220
Ah, let me see it!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:26.200
I wonder if Onee-chan's a bit more like an idol now?

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:30.360
<i>Ahem, I am currently outside of the theater.</i>

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:35.720
<i>I'm currently on my way to return the props we used for drama class in the underground storeroom.</i>

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:38.720
<i>Ahem, I am now in the basement.</i>

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.040
<i>It's kind of dark and spacious...</i>

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.720
<i>I'm lost.</i>

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:48.000
She hasn't changed at all.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.740
That's the good part about her.

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:53.260
Coach Ran...

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:55.380
It's tough right off the bat.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.840
I-I'm hungry...

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.740
It's a text from Hikari.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:10.040
<i>About the Special Audition, the three of you are going to want Premium Dress cards for it.</i>

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:14.160
<i>I'll definitely be watching you. Don't let me down.</i>

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.060
<i>Hikari</i>

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:19.180
Alright! 100 more squats!

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:20.460
Another 100?

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:23.200
She really is a Demon Coach!

00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:57.950
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.900 --> 00:24:02.200
I want to be cool like Hikari-chan!

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:05.040
They how about trying to imitate her for your training?

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:05.860
Bright!

00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:07.060
You're starting from there?

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:10.080
Rivals are the spice of life!

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:12.980
It's finally time for the Special Audition!

00:24:12.980 --> 00:24:14.720
Ran really is a Demon Coach!

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:17.380
I said I'm not a demon! At least not yet.

00:24:17.380 --> 00:24:18.700
Huh?

00:24:18.700 --> 00:24:20.220
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.220 --> 00:24:21.580
Move on now!

00:24:21.580 --> 00:24:25.720
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
